# ── Personal career data must NEVER be committed ──────────────────────────
# This repo is public. A résumé pushed here is public forever, including in
# git history after deletion. The plugin writes user data into career/ —
# keep every form of it out.
career/
**/career/
*profile.md
*source-resume*
*claims.json
*104-application.md
*evidence-map.md
*gaps.md
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc

# Synthetic test fixtures are not personal data — the patterns above would
# otherwise swallow tests/fixtures/profile.md and silently break the suite
# for anyone who clones this repo.
!tests/fixtures/**

# ── Everything else ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.plugin
.venv/
node_modules/
